From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: emuTOS-MCD <darekadumon@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 03:39:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 004/185] segacd: A: ramdisk as a floppy-shaped block device
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The boot loader reads a FAT12 image from the CD into PRG-RAM bank 3;
the floppy hooks (Lisa pattern) serve it as drive A: with plain
memcpy sector I/O — writable, though volatile. GEMDOS mounts it,
EmuDesk shows the drive icon, windows open on real files. B: is
reserved for the backup RAM cartridge proxy.
---
 bios/floppy.c    | 16 +++++++++++++
 bios/segacd.c    | 59 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 bios/segacd.h    |  8 +++++++
 include/config.h |  3 ---
 4 files changed, 83 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

